        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Route 404 – Are You Ready for a Dark Journey?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will this journey heal you, or deepen the fear within?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former bus attendant living in the shadow of what you lost in a traumatic accident. You've decided to return to life by hitting the road again. But this time, the journey transforms into a nightmare that pulls you in, not just the passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the line between reality and illusion. The darkness awaits you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route 404</strong> is a first-person, story-driven psychological horror and survival experience. As a bus attendant, you must cater to the passengers' needs while confronting the darkness looming over your past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Attendant Duties:</strong> Serve passengers, resolve complaints, manage the bus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> Your past traumas constantly manipulate your perception of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequential Choices:</strong> The decisions you make will determine the game's outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horror Elements:</strong> Sudden jump scares, atmospheric sound design, and mysterious events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story:</strong> Follow the struggle of a mind scarred by an accident, fighting for recovery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGERS AWAIT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bus lights can flicker and die without warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the passengers might be watching you a little too closely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds from the luggage compartment echo with memories you've tried to forget.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>that presence</strong>... capable of being anywhere, at any time... is impatient to find you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>After all that's happened... I need to stop and breathe. It's time to wipe the slate clean and rejoin life.</i>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is about to begin.<br><strong>Will you run, or will you face it?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Route 404 – Are You Ready for a Dark Journey?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will this journey heal you, or deepen the fear within?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a former bus attendant living in the shadow of what you lost in a traumatic accident. You've decided to return to life by hitting the road again. But this time, the journey transforms into a nightmare that pulls you in, not just the passengers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the line between reality and illusion. The darkness awaits you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Route 404</strong> is a first-person, story-driven psychological horror and survival experience. As a bus attendant, you must cater to the passengers' needs while confronting the darkness looming over your past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Attendant Duties:</strong> Serve passengers, resolve complaints, manage the bus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> Your past traumas constantly manipulate your perception of reality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequential Choices:</strong> The decisions you make will determine the game's outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Horror Elements:</strong> Sudden jump scares, atmospheric sound design, and mysterious events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Story:</strong> Follow the struggle of a mind scarred by an accident, fighting for recovery.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DANGERS AWAIT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bus lights can flicker and die without warning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the passengers might be watching you a little too closely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds from the luggage compartment echo with memories you've tried to forget.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>that presence</strong>... capable of being anywhere, at any time... is impatient to find you.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARE YOU READY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>After all that's happened... I need to stop and breathe. It's time to wipe the slate clean and rejoin life.</i>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey is about to begin.<br><strong>Will you run, or will you face it?</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "After the accident, Jack withdraws into himself and starts working as a bus attendant to get his life back on track. He constantly sees hallucinations. And in these hallucinations, the decision is yours. Each decision will lead you to a different ending!",
